(% class="legend-box" %)
**One guide per job — 22 total.** Each guide covers level 1 → endgame, organised by slot. Trust recommendations, every-slot picks, and an endgame cheat-sheet at the bottom. Items use **bg-wiki.com** links.

(% class="legend-box" %)
**Marker key:** (% style="color:#f1c40f" %)🏆 Best-in-slot(%%) · (% style="color:#7fdbff" %)⭐ Strong endgame(%%) · (% style="color:#b39ddb" %)🟣 Rare/Ex(%%) · (% style="color:#fff176" %)🟡 Rare(%%)

----

= 🛡️ Tanks =

{{html clean="false"}}
<table class="gt">
<thead><tr><th style="width:160px;">Job</th><th>Role / Niche</th></tr></thead>
<tbody>
<tr><td class="role-tank"><a class="job-link" href="Paladin">Paladin</a></td><td>Sword + shield, divine cures, Sentinel/Cover/Flash. The classic tank — eats hits, holds hate, cures with MND</td></tr>
<tr><td class="role-tank"><a class="job-link" href="Rune%20Fencer">Rune Fencer</a></td><td>Sword/GS hybrid tank. Runes for elemental damage + resistance. Phalanx, Vallation, Lunge magic, self-Refresh</td></tr>
<tr><td class="role-tank"><a class="job-link" href="Ninja">Ninja</a></td><td>Evasion / Utsusemi tank or DPS. Dual wield, no self-cures — needs healer backup</td></tr>
</tbody>
</table>
{{/html}}

