= ⚔️ Melee DPS =

{{html clean="false"}}
<table class="gt">
<thead><tr><th style="width:160px;">Job</th><th>Role / Niche</th></tr></thead>
<tbody>
<tr><td class="role-melee"><a class="job-link" href="Warrior">Warrior</a></td><td>Great Axe / Axe / Sword. Berserk/Aggressor/Defender. Tank-or-DD flex, Steel Cyclone WS king</td></tr>
<tr><td class="role-melee"><a class="job-link" href="Monk">Monk</a></td><td>Hand-to-Hand. Chakra / Counterstance / Focus. Self-cure via Chakra, Asuran Fists endgame</td></tr>
<tr><td class="role-melee"><a class="job-link" href="Thief">Thief</a></td><td>Dagger. Sneak Attack + Trick Attack + Treasure Hunter. Positional burst DPS</td></tr>
<tr><td class="role-melee"><a class="job-link" href="Dark%20Knight">Dark Knight</a></td><td>Scythe / GS. Stun / Last Resort / Souleater / Drain / Aspir. Glass-cannon DPS</td></tr>
<tr><td class="role-melee"><a class="job-link" href="Samurai">Samurai</a></td><td>Great Katana. Hasso / Meditate / Third Eye. Store TP master — 5/6-hit builds</td></tr>
<tr><td class="role-melee"><a class="job-link" href="Dragoon">Dragoon</a></td><td>Polearm + Wyvern pet. Jumps / High Jump / Spirit Surge. Penta Thrust / Stardiver burst</td></tr>
<tr><td class="role-melee"><a class="job-link" href="Beastmaster">Beastmaster</a></td><td>Axe + charmed pet. Solo king. CHR-stacked charm gear, pet sink for any mob</td></tr>
<tr><td class="role-melee"><a class="job-link" href="Blue%20Mage">Blue Mage</a></td><td>Sword + BLU spells. Melee/magic hybrid — Chain Affinity, Cannonball, Vorpal Blade</td></tr>
<tr><td class="role-melee"><a class="job-link" href="Dancer">Dancer</a></td><td>Dagger + self-Waltzes/Steps/Samba. Self-sustaining DPS with no MP</td></tr>
<tr><td class="role-melee"><a class="job-link" href="Puppetmaster">Puppetmaster</a></td><td>Hand-to-Hand + Automaton pet. Frame-based gameplay (Sharpshot/Stormwaker/Soulsoother/Spiritreaver/Valoredge)</td></tr>
</tbody>
</table>
{{/html}}

