= 📋 What's in each guide =

{{html clean="false"}}
<table class="gt">
<thead><tr><th style="width:200px;">Section</th><th>Contents</th></tr></thead>
<tbody>
<tr><td><strong>Trust Recommendations</strong></td><td>5-trust party tailored to that job — based on what gambits each trust actually casts. **Every job has a different ideal team.**</td></tr>
<tr><td><strong>Weapons</strong></td><td>Full level 1 → 75/95/99 progression for every weapon type the job uses. Mythic / Relic / Empyrean called out</td></tr>
<tr><td><strong>Armor (per slot)</strong></td><td>Head / Body / Hands / Legs / Feet — every slot, every level bracket, no gaps</td></tr>
<tr><td><strong>Accessories</strong></td><td>Neck · Earrings · Rings · Back · Waist · Ammo</td></tr>
<tr><td><strong>Endgame Cheat-Sheet</strong></td><td>Pre-built loadouts: TP Build, WS, Healing, Pet, Tank, MP-Recovered-While-Healing, etc. — whatever the job actually swaps between</td></tr>
</tbody>
</table>
{{/html}}

