(% class="legend-box" %)
**Sources:** Gear data adapted from FFXIclopedia community guides (Eclipstic, Aislin, Ashmada, Andres, Alamoth, Mogul, Juso, Derableska) and BG-Wiki (Community Rune Fencer Guide, Compendium of Colure for Geomancer). Trust recommendations built from the actual gambits in our trust scripts.
